{
  "name": "Kinetic Blade",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you form the energy of your element into a weapon-like shape of your choice, which lasts until you are incapacitated or dismiss it as a Bonus Action. You cannot use this shape if you have already used your kinetic blast this turn.</p><p>As an Action, you can make a melee spell attack with this shape against a target of your choice within 5 ft of you, dealing your kinetic shape die + your CHA modifier + your Proficiency modifier damage of your chosen element's type.</p><p>Additionally, your ability to defend yourself with this shape grants you a +1 bonus to your AC while maintaining it.</p>",
